ion<br>-Please proceed through the following steps to cancel.<br>1. Go to the Google Play Store<br>2. From the menu icon on the top right &gt; Tap &quot;Payments &amp; Subscriptions&quot;<br>3. Select the subscription you want to cancel from the list<br>4. Tap &quot;Cancel subscription&quot; and follow the instructions on screen",
